    {
      "id": "inverted",
      "topic": "verbs",
      "title": "Feelings take the dative",
      "body": "Verbs of feeling, wanting and having treat the person as the object: მიყვარს is literally “(it) is loved to me”. The prefix shows who: მ- me, გ- you, ∅/ს- him or her.",
